            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👉 Build your gym. Train your clients. Hire your staff. Expand your empire.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Gym Empire, you start in a small storage closet and gradually build a fitness empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e20a4d90950d4f476fe7fb9e80093d51.poster.avif?t=1790246974\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e20a4d90950d4f476fe7fb9e80093d51.webm?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e20a4d90950d4f476fe7fb9e80093d51.mp4?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💪 Build Your Gym</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and expand your gym with a wide range of facilities and equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build dedicated areas for:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🥊 Boxing<br>🏀 Basketball<br>🏊 Swimming<br>🤼 Wrestling<br>🏈 Football</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as your gym grows, unlock new locations, including the <strong>Beach Front</strong> and <strong>Zen</strong> gyms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.poster.avif?t=1790246974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.webm?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.mp4?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👥 Manage Your Clients</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your clients aren't just numbers on a spreadsheet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They walk around your gym, use equipment, train with staff and develop their own routines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep them happy, keep them training and give them a gym worth coming back to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.poster.avif?t=1790246974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.webm?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/e38a34dbe1fd3caa28ae6b5dde64f2e2.mp4?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👨‍💼 Build Your Team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to help run your gym and train your clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your business grows, you'll need to manage your employees, clients and facilities while making sure everything runs smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/7f64a0c3e4fb8b71480dbbb455e4246b.poster.avif?t=1790246974\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/7f64a0c3e4fb8b71480dbbb455e4246b.webm?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/7f64a0c3e4fb8b71480dbbb455e4246b.mp4?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Compete Against Rival Gyms</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think your gym is the best?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put it to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>Yearly Competitions</strong> and compete against rival gyms to prove that your business deserves to be on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/1bad5bbc1e5bfc5c9dc57bcb70c62414.poster.avif?t=1790246974\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/1bad5bbc1e5bfc5c9dc57bcb70c62414.webm?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/756300/extras/1bad5bbc1e5bfc5c9dc57bcb70c62414.mp4?t=1790246974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Grow Your Empire</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure <strong>local and global sponsorships</strong>, attract <strong>Gym Celebrities</strong>, deal with <strong>Roiders</strong>, customise your gym and keep expanding your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's always another upgrade to chase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another facility to build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another client to impress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another rival gym to beat.</p>",
