                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I enjoyed it at first, but...\n\n1. after manually upping the membership fee (which you have to do often) you ALSO have to individually cancel old memberships with cheaper rates.\n\n2. It's hard to impossible to tell which fee makes sense while\n\n3. upkeep costs and injuries will turn your life hell unless you micromanage every customer's training.\n\n\n\nDoesn't work as an idler, isn't really fun with the active gameplay. Shame, I was really excited to play this.",
